      "review_description": "We signed up in july and coming up to December and we are still no closer to being able to use Solar even though the panels have been on the roof since August. This company is the worst company I have ever dealt with. Do yourself a favour and save yourself the absolute nightmare that follows. They are still selling these systems on a daily basis when they don’t even have the supplies to finish a job that was signed up in July. If I don’t constantly reach out to them all I hear is crickets. This is the most expensive system around which I thought would give me a good quality product and people who knew what they were doing but know I’m left wondering if these panels are ever going to work. Don’t know who to get to fix this problem.",
