      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "From the first contact with Cheral, to Julian and Leanne who then organised everything, to the installers to the inspector, everyone from Climasolar have shown professionalism, respect, knowledge, great people skills, were not pushy and communicated exceptionally well in advance throughout the whole process.During installation the workmanship was excellent plus they kept the site tidy at all times.Great communication between the installers and the office was observed.We were instantly informed / consulted with regard to any changes that needed to be made. All had our best interests foremost and made changes where necessary.Post installation: they are easy to contact and quick to respond. They have been diligent in obtaining the Government Rebate even when the Government put a halt on further rebates until July 1st they kept us informed and ensured our application was submitted and was in the system.We have had no problems post  installation and are now reaping the benefits of being paid for excess Solar electricity going to the grid even during this very cold and wet winter. Look forward to summer when we will reap even greater benefits.",
